"uibu" is distinctive enough because 'ui' is distinctive... but I
can't distinguish py. and by. Ignoring any technicalities; no aspiration or
anything else. In English (Bi) and (Pi) are difficult to tell apart, while
in Arabic (Zey=z) as a letter can't be mistaken for (Dhal=th in then).
